&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3007&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e8b09eaee7a3&quot;&gt;Lead programs across four archetypes: deep technical, large cross-functional, product delivery, and operational&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3122&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d677451691b&quot;&gt;Accelerate alignment by removing friction and overhead, not by adding process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3204&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dc73befb7b61&quot;&gt;Hold the judgment call on when to escalate, when to slow down, when a technical decision has organizational implications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3328&quot; data-local-id=&quot;090cca129a3d&quot;&gt;Own outcomes, not activities - your value is measured by what ships and what never had the chance to become a problem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3449&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ef6257af49f5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e329b0bcd949&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3485&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b8b45c6d5239&quot;&gt;5+ years of technical program management at a high-growth technology company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3565&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0496a950aa58&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive large, ambiguous, cross-functional programs to completion with minimal direction&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3679&quot; data-local-id=&quot;38a102442f66&quot;&gt;Engineering credibility earned through hands-on experience with technically complex domains — observability, infrastructure, data platforms, or AI/ML systems including model training pipelines, ML infrastructure, and GPU compute. You can go deep on architecture and system design, push back on technical decisions, and hold your own in the room with staff engineers and senior ICs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4064&quot; data-local-id=&quot;10f00048c31b&quot;&gt;Track record of earning trust with senior engineering and product leadership - not through title, through judgment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4182&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1452cd0612be&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication; comfortable owning the narrative at VP+ levels&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4273&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6fb62d974c3d&quot;&gt;Active AI practitioner, you use AI tools in your daily work and can demonstrate how they’ve changed your leverage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4390&quot; data-local-id=&quot;547b07feb857&quot;&gt;You have built something, a tool, a template, an automated workflow, that other people use&lt;/p&gt;
