&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4505&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6cfc062a23e8&quot;&gt;You identified a systemic problem no one asked you to find and built the operating system to solve it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4610&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b54c02b72c88&quot;&gt;You automated a program lifecycle or workflow that previously required manual coordination&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4704&quot; data-local-id=&quot;48a33e6e9a8f&quot;&gt;You have operated in observability, infrastructure, data platforms, or AI/ML environments and can speak to the technical architecture, not just the program execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4873&quot; data-local-id=&quot;43b20bf14850&quot;&gt;You have managed programs with real unit economics implications - cloud cost, capacity, margin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
