&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4273&quot; data-local-id=&quot;40bd990a8873&quot;&gt;Active AI practitioner, you use AI tools in your daily work and can demonstrate how they’ve changed your leverage&lt;/p&gt;
