&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4610&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d66174f55713&quot;&gt;You automated a program lifecycle or workflow that previously required manual coordination&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4704&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c526d6dcf374&quot;&gt;You have operated in observability, infrastructure, data platforms, or AI/ML environments and can speak to the technical architecture, not just the program execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4873&quot; data-local-id=&quot;788946920c7c&quot;&gt;You have managed programs with real unit economics implications - cloud cost, capacity, margin&lt;/p&gt;
