&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4971&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d79d64968ea3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datadog Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4d630a2ac109&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5266&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2a417025a79c&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5338&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ddd9b481e46a&quot;&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5415&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6e252ecfdb88&quot;&gt;Assigned TPM mentor and engineering buddy program for learning and relationship building&lt;/p&gt;
